Ray Chason wrote:

>This rumor refers to a situation that no longer exists in the game.  Before
>NetHack 3.0.0, it was possible to be petrified if a cockatrice hissed at you
>while you were swallowed:
>
>
>    Outside, you hear the cockatrice's hissing!--More--
>    The purple worm is turned to stone!--More--
>    And the same fate befalls you.--More--
>    Do you want your possessions identified?
>
>
>So if you had heard hissing outside, you would now be a statue.

Thank you very much! I never knew it since I played NetHack from
3.1.3.
That exactly explains what the rumor say. Thanks again!


